\newlabel{tab-perjoint-baselines}{{2}{11}{Per-joint test RMSE [\si {\newton \meter }]. Joint~7 is the revealing case: RNEA alone reaches \num {0.042} there, and the learned residual \emph {degrades} that result by a factor of \num {6.9}}{table.caption.26}{}}
